   "options": null,
   "answer": [],
   "accept": null,
   "answerText": "$X=\\sum X_i\\sim B(200,0.6)$，$E=120, D=48$。\n$P(X\\le k)\\ge0.999$，标准化 $P\\left(Z\\le\\frac{k-120}{\\sqrt{48}}\\right)\\ge0.999$。\n$\\frac{k-120}{\\sqrt{48}}\\ge3\\Rightarrow k\\ge120+3\\sqrt{48}\\approx120+20.8=140.8$。\n取 $k=141$（向上取整），即至少供应 **141 千瓦**。",
